Package: taaAttribution
Title: Flexible Brinson Performance Attribution Dashboard
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("TAA", "Team", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "team@example.com")
Description: A Shiny dashboard for importing return series, enriching instrument
    metadata, defining portfolios and composite benchmarks, and calculating
    Brinson-Fachler attribution with a separate currency effect.
